<title>USA: Greenbrier sees Q2, yr below expectations.</title>
<headline>Greenbrier sees Q2, yr below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenbrier Cos said Friday it expects earnings for the fiscal second quarter and full year to fall significantly below analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>Greenbrier said earnings for both the manufacturing and leasing and services segments of its business will be below earlier expectations.</p>
<p>According to First Call, the mean estimate for Greenbrier's second quarter, ended today, is $0.25 a share, down from $0.39 a year earlier.</p>
